<section image-layout="blank" id="WRJLRrp5S9" vertical-align="center"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item><h2>Aufhebung changes the practice without erasing every claim</h2><p font-size="18pt"><b>Aufhebung</b>, often translated as “sublation,” combines negation and preservation: a limited form is canceled while something valid within it is carried into a changed whole.</p><freeform-block w="840" h="225"><box type="content" x="0" y="0" w="245" h="32" sizing="fixed"><p role="eyebrow">Canceled · domination</p></box><box type="content" x="300" y="0" w="245" h="32" sizing="fixed"><p role="eyebrow">Preserved · each claim</p></box><box type="content" x="590" y="0" w="250" h="32" sizing="fixed"><p role="eyebrow">Transformed · the rule</p></box><box type="content" x="0" y="54" w="170" h="52" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="accent" style="padding:4pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt"><b>A · most airtime</b></p></box><box type="content" x="174" y="54" w="25" h="52" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="surface"><p align="center" font-size="16pt">B</p></box><box type="content" x="201" y="54" w="25" h="52" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="surface"><p align="center" font-size="16pt">C</p></box><box type="content" x="228" y="54" w="25" h="52" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="surface"><p align="center" font-size="16pt">D</p></box><shape preset="line" x="268" y="42" w="2" h="76" stroke="accent" stroke-width="5"></shape><shape preset="rightArrow" x="278" y="67" w="30" h="24" fill="palette-3" stroke-width="0"></shape><box type="content" x="315" y="58" w="32" h="44" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-3"><p align="center" font-size="16pt"><b>A</b></p></box><box type="content" x="352" y="58" w="32" h="44" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-3"><p align="center" font-size="16pt"><b>B</b></p></box><box type="content" x="389" y="58" w="32" h="44" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-3"><p align="center" font-size="16pt"><b>C</b></p></box><box type="content" x="426" y="58" w="32" h="44" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-3"><p align="center" font-size="16pt"><b>D</b></p></box><box type="content" x="463" y="58" w="32" h="44" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-3"><p align="center" font-size="16pt"><b>E</b></p></box><box type="content" x="500" y="58" w="32" h="44" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-3"><p align="center" font-size="16pt"><b>F</b></p></box><shape preset="rightArrow" x="545" y="65" w="34" h="28" fill="palette-2" stroke-width="0"></shape><box type="content" x="590" y="54" w="38" h="52" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-2"><p align="center" font-size="16pt"><b>A</b></p></box><box type="content" x="632" y="54" w="38" h="52" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-2"><p align="center" font-size="16pt"><b>B</b></p></box><box type="content" x="674" y="54" w="38" h="52" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-2"><p align="center" font-size="16pt"><b>C</b></p></box><box type="content" x="716" y="54" w="38" h="52" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-2"><p align="center" font-size="16pt"><b>D</b></p></box><box type="content" x="758" y="54" w="38" h="52" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-2"><p align="center" font-size="16pt"><b>E</b></p></box><box type="content" x="800" y="54" w="38" h="52" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-2"><p align="center" font-size="16pt"><b>F</b></p></box><box type="content" x="0" y="132" w="245" h="78" sizing="fixed"><h4>Stop unrestricted interruption</h4><p font-size="16pt">It no longer governs the exchange.</p></box><box type="content" x="300" y="132" w="245" h="78" sizing="fixed"><h4>Carry every participant through</h4><p font-size="16pt">The entitlement to contribute survives.</p></box><box type="content" x="590" y="132" w="250" h="78" sizing="fixed"><h4>Reorganize participation</h4><p font-size="16pt">Turn structure makes speaking answerable and shared.</p></box></freeform-block><p font-size="18pt"><b>Check:</b> what disappears, what survives, and what becomes possible only in the changed whole?</p></grid-item></grid></section>